<blockquote class="uncited"><div>From memory the 1750Hz tone was set to 50% system deviation, like the DTMF tones.  About 1.25KHz on narrow and about 2.5kHz on wide.  So it sounds like it is working as intended. <br><br>Colin G4EML</div></blockquote>Good to know.<br><br>My issue has been my V2 radio that seems to be much narrower on both RX and TX.<br>On RX I had problems with clipping when I had both squelch and RX subtone.<br>It got better when I used 0% squelch and relied on the subtone.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2867">SA0BUX</a> — Sun Jun 08, 2025 3:03 pm</p><hr />
