		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=5156&amp;p=37397#p37397"><![CDATA[
Hello,<br><br>The frequency counter shows 1740 Hz, which is 10 Hz too low.<br><br>But I think the sound isn't modulated enough, which is why the repeaters can't be opened. It's noticeable that this only affects brand-new devices with V5 firmware!<br><br>73 Alfred OE7ABH<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=1060">oe7abh</a> — Sat Jun 07, 2025 9:52 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
